flowchart TD
    A[Public signals\nHN / GitHub Issues / Lobsters / Future adapters] --> B[Source adapters]
    B --> C[Ingestion & normalization]
    C --> D[Raw evidence store\nURLs + source context + collection timestamp]
    D --> E[Problem extraction]
    E --> F[Candidate problem records]

    F --> G{Evidence review}
    G -->|Support| H[Evidence registry]
    G -->|Counter-evidence| I[Counter-evidence registry]
    G -->|Insufficient| J[Unresolved problem]

    H --> K[Provenance validation\nPublished / collected / verified timestamps\nIndependence + corroboration]
    I --> K
    K --> L[Versioned problem registry]

    L --> M{Registry contract valid?}
    M -->|No| N[Reject update\nReport validation errors]
    M -->|Yes| O[Inspectable registry API\nvalidate / list / show / export]

    O --> P{Controlled investigation}
    P --> Q[Existing solutions &\nconventional baseline]
    P --> R[Falsifiable question]
    P --> S[Reproduction / measurement]
    Q --> T[Residual gap assessment]
    R --> T
    S --> T

    T --> U{Decision}
    U -->|Gap disproven| V[Rejected]
    U -->|Evidence incomplete| W[Unresolved]
    U -->|Gap survives| X[Validated problem]

    V --> L
    W --> L
    X --> Y[Hackathon feasibility gate]
    Y --> Y1[Open-model necessity]
    Y --> Y2[Nebius inference / deployment / scaling]
    Y --> Y3[Buildability + judging fit]
    Y1 --> Z{Feasible?}
    Y2 --> Z
    Y3 --> Z
    Z -->|No| V
    Z -->|Yes| AA[Prototype against best baseline]

    AA --> AB[User outcomes / experiment results]
    AB --> AC[Feedback and assumptions]
    AC --> L

    L -. controlled status transition .-> AD[Audit history\nActor + reason + timestamp]
    AD --> L

    style L fill:#1f4b5f,color:#fff,stroke:#8fd3e8
    style O fill:#285943,color:#fff,stroke:#9be7b0
    style AA fill:#684b1c,color:#fff,stroke:#f4cf75
    style N fill:#642f35,color:#fff,stroke:#f5a6ad
